  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBSA Climate Finance Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DBSA Climate Finance Facility Programme is a lending facility that aims to address market constraints, play a catalytic role with a blended finance approach, to increase climate related investments in the Southern African region. 

&#x2022; The programme will be the first private sector-driven climate finance facility of its kind, a pioneering Green Bank model, adapted for developing countries.
&#x2022; The programme will address critical market barriers to accelerate private sector climate investments to scale, helping countries to achieve their targets in NDCs. 
&#x2022; The programme will involve a significant engagement of MSMEs, local banks and institutional investors such as pension funds</narrative>
  </description>
